---
import Layout from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Umi-Time"
  description="Privacy policy for the Umi-Time website."
>
  <div class="umi-region umi-pad">
    <main class="page page-roadmap">
      <header class="page-header">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

        <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> November 2, 2026</p>

        <p>
          Umi-Time is an open-source project and informational website. We value
          visitor privacy and aim to collect as little information as practical.
        </p>
      </header>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>Information We Do Not Collect</h2>

        <p>This website does not:</p>

        <ul>
          <li>Require user accounts or registration</li>
          <li>Accept form submissions</li>
          <li>Provide advertising or marketing services</li>
          <li>Sell personal information</li>
          <li>Use social media tracking pixels</li>
          <li>Intentionally collect personal information from visitors</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>Website Hosting and Delivery</h2>

        <p>
          The Umi-Time website is hosted using GitHub Pages and delivered
          through Cloudflare.
        </p>

        <p>
          When you visit this website, these service providers may process
          technical information necessary to operate, secure, and deliver the
          site, including:
        </p>

        <ul>
          <li>IP address</li>
          <li>Browser and device information</li>
          <li>Requested pages and resources</li>
          <li>Date and time of requests</li>
          <li>Network and performance information</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
          This information is processed by the hosting and infrastructure
          providers as part of operating the website and maintaining service
          reliability and security.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>Analytics</h2>

        <p>
          Umi-Time may use privacy-focused analytics provided by Cloudflare to
          better understand aggregate website activity and improve the project's
          documentation and resources.
        </p>

        <p>Analytics information may include:</p>

        <ul>
          <li>Page views</li>
          <li>Popular pages and content</li>
          <li>Referring websites</li>
          <li>Approximate geographic regions</li>
          <li>Browser and device trends</li>
          <li>Website performance metrics</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
          Analytics are used only to understand overall website usage and
          project interest. Umi-Time does not use analytics for advertising,
          behavioral profiling, or cross-site tracking.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>Cookies</h2>

        <p>
          Umi-Time does not intentionally use cookies for advertising,
          personalization, or visitor profiling.
        </p>

        <p>
          Service providers involved in operating the website may use technical
          mechanisms necessary to provide security, performance, and content
          delivery.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>External Links</h2>

        <p>
          This website contains links to third-party websites, including GitHub
          and other external resources.
        </p>

        <p>
          When you follow an external link, you leave the Umi-Time website and
          become subject to the privacy practices and policies of the
          destination site.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>Data Retention</h2>

        <p>Umi-Time does not maintain a database of visitor information.</p>

        <p>
          Technical logs and operational data retained by hosting or
          infrastructure providers are governed by the policies and retention
          practices of those providers.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>International Visitors</h2>

        <p>
          This website is publicly accessible worldwide. Information necessary
          to deliver website content may be processed in jurisdictions different
          from your own.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>

        <p>
          This privacy policy may be updated from time to time as the website,
          infrastructure, or project requirements evolve. Any updates will be
          reflected on this page along with a revised "Last updated" date.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>Related Information</h2>

        <p>
          For information about open-source licensing and intellectual property,
          please see the <a href="/licensing/">Licensing page</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>Contact</h2>

        <p>
          Questions regarding this privacy policy or the Umi-Time project may be
          directed through the Umi-Time GitHub organization.
        </p>
      </section>
    </main>
  </div>
</Layout>
